horsefollow.command.help.title=[HorseFollow] Commands:
horsefollow.command.help.bind=/horsefollow bind - Bind via item (Horse_Feed/Ram_Feed + F). Command only for operators, when not mounted.
horsefollow.command.help.unbind=/horsefollow unbind - Break the bond with your mount.
horsefollow.command.help.status=/horsefollow status - Shows if you have a bound mount.
horsefollow.command.config_use_distance=[HorseFollow] Use /horsefollow distance <value> to set teleport distance (0 to disable).
horsefollow.command.help.call=/horsefollow call - Call your mount over to you.
horsefollow.command.help.distance=/horsefollow distance <value> - Set teleport distance in blocks (0 to disable).
horsefollow.command.help.stay=/horsefollow stay - Makes your bound mount stay in place.
horsefollow.command.help.reload=/horsefollow reload - Reloads the mod to apply distance and/or language updates.
